      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If my internet drops for split second, it's not enough to drop connection to vrc itself, but all social updates (people going offline/online/changing world) and even any notifications (invites/invite requests) stop coming to my client until I fully restart the game. Everything continues to function correctly in vrcx even without restarting it.",
