      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: can confirm this issue is still active and has not been resolved randomly. ive had this issue for roughly 2-3 months and it will randomly stop updating the info (primarily after i try joining a world and get booted back to my homeworld)\n\nedit: while in vrchat. i did exactly what the person above said and unchecked IPV6 and saw my entire friend list and notifications show again\n\nedit 2: turning ipv6 off also stops avatars from erroring, i dont get booted back to my homeworld when trying to join worlds, majority of the issues ive had. are gone with it off",
